| 功能域 | FR | 页面编号 | 架构依据 |
|---|---|---|---|
| 导航/Home | FR-001–004、NFR-011 | UI-00–02 | ADR-01、ADR-03、ADR-12 |
| 视觉一致性/适配与技术核验 | FR-005、NFR-007/009/010 | UI-01、UI-37 | ADR-01、ADR-10 |
| Profile | FR-010–017 | UI-06–09 | ADR-02、ADR-03、ADR-09 |
| Override | FR-020–026 | UI-10–14 | ADR-02、ADR-06、ADR-07 |
